7
00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:14.240
the lecture’s four stages and

8
00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:15.800
derive the exact number of

9
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.640
production applications for a nonempty

10
00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:18.480
word.

11
00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:22.740
The lecture example begins with

12
00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:24.680
S becoming A S A

13
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.600
or a B, A becoming

14
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.660
B or S, and B

15
00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:30.860
becoming b or epsilon. Add

16
00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:32.320
