17
00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.380
with a unit rule to

18
00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:35.160
the old S. The fresh

19
00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.720
start will never appear on

20
00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.760
