43
00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:21.000
Next eliminate unit rules by

44
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.660
copying all reachable non-unit alternatives.

45
00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:25.920
Remove the useless self-rule S

46
00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:28.120
becomes S, replace S zero

47
00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:29.760
becoming S, and propagate the

48
00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:31.460
non-unit options through A becoming

49
00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:33.500
B or S. Stopping after

50
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:35.400
replacing one visible unit arrow

51
00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:36.660
can miss a longer chain

52
00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:37.620
